{"version":1,"content":"<p>人工智能初創公司Architect Labs聲稱，其實驗性Frostbite（寒霜） CPU架構的每瓦性能比傳統處理器核心高4.59倍，單位面積性能高8.77倍。Frostbite從零開始利用人工智能設計，採用了一種截然不同的計算方法，但其令人矚目的成果尚未在實際晶片上得到驗證。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587302.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.093800+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_hash":"bd8c5a45c94c0cf22e86170be0b19595f5538a724724e0db0f500649a9843c10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}